CMIS Area Blank in Anthology', 'CMIS Area Blank in Anthology', '[{"id": "843447", "vendor": null}]'::jsonb, '15669', 'Students are unable to register for gatherings because their CMIS Area field in Anthology is blank. When the system cannot detect a CMIS Area, it incorrectly shows that there are no available gatherings. Manually populating the CMIS Area with the correct code:name value immediately restores access to gatherings. This indicates a failure in the CMIS sync process to consistently populate or maintain the Area field for all students.', 'ICS', null, null, 'Manually add the CMIS Area', 'Closed by ICS.  There was an outdated Anthology API key that had to be updated.  Logic updated to treat Restricted Area students like non-members and the system looks to the master record address if needed.', null, null, date '2026-09-15'),
