Expected behavior: When a student is no longer registered in a PC course, their associated PC Gathering should automatically drop, allowing them to select a new Gathering for the next term.', 'ICS', 'TBD', null, null, 'Closed by Mitch Jackson.  Updated the flow that detects PC and EC courses and their statuses so that Gathering enrollments are more accurate.', null, null, date '2026-09-15'),
