  ('Transcripts', 'Transcripts', 10, 'closed', 55, '-', '2026-05-29', date '2026-05-29', '20511 (Ellucian) - Transcript: Incorrect CUM GPA Displayed for Terms with W Grades', 'Transcript: Incorrect CUM GPA Displayed for Terms with W Grades', '[{"id": "20511", "vendor": "Ellucian"}]'::jsonb, null, 'For terms containing only W (withdrawal) grades, the Cumulative GPA on the Attribute Transcript displayed an incorrect carried-over value instead of the expected 0.00.', 'Ellucian (Barry Dunphy)', '6/4/2026 - Resolved (fix delivered via Attribute Transcript release)', date '2026-06-04', 'None', 'Resolved - CUM GPA logic for W/WT/WV/P-grade terms corrected on the Attribute Transcript; team elected not to patch the legacy transcript given its imminent retirement', null, null, date '2026-09-15'),
  ('Transcripts', 'Transcripts', 10, 'closed', 56, '-', '2026-04-02', date '2026-04-02', '20491 (Ellucian) - Additional GPA Earned Credits Incorrectly Shows 0 Credits on Religion Courses', 'Additional GPA Earned Credits Incorrectly Shows 0 Credits on Religion Courses', '[{"id": "20491", "vendor": "Ellucian"}]'::jsonb, null, 'Approved Religion transfer credits (e.g. a course approved for 2 credits) showed 0 Credits Earned under Additional GPA, causing the course to not count toward the transcript''s credit total.', 'Ellucian (Barry Dunphy)', '4/8/2026 - Resolved', date '2026-04-08', 'None', 'Resolved - Additional GPA logic updated to reference internal approved transfer credits; deployed to Production and closed 4/8/2026', null, null, date '2026-09-15'),
  ('Transcripts', 'Transcripts', 10, 'closed', 57, '-', '2025-04-10', date '2025-04-10', '20373 (BYU-PW/Ellucian) - Course Status Showing Completed but Missing Grades', 'Course Status Showing Completed but Missing Grades', '[{"id": "20373", "vendor": "BYU-PW/Ellucian"}]'::jsonb, '524', 'During review of internal legacy-system courses, records were found in Anthology with Course Status = Complete but no letter grade assigned, and the grade-entry field only offered the asterisked (transfer) grade option, not the standard one.', 'BYU-PW (Aniekan Winner Anietie)', '6/4/2026 - Resolved', date '2026-06-04', 'None', 'Resolved - 524 missing-grade Complete-status records cleaned up by BYU-PW (Winner) as of 6/4/2026', null, null, date '2026-09-15'),
  ('Transcripts', 'Transcripts', 10, 'closed', 58, '-', '2026-05-11', date '2026-05-11', '20508 (Ellucian) - Courses Not Displaying on Transcript When First Semester Contains W Grades', 'Courses Not Displaying on Transcript When First Semester Contains W Grades', '[{"id": "20508", "vendor": "Ellucian"}]'::jsonb, null, 'Course records visible in Student Courses were missing entirely from the official transcript specifically when a student''s first transcript semester contained only W (withdrawal) grades.', 'Ellucian (Barry Dunphy)', '5/13/2026 - Resolved', date '2026-05-13', 'None', 'Resolved - join-condition bug fixed so W-grade-only first semesters display on transcript; deployed to Production and closed 5/13/2026', null, null, date '2026-09-15'),
  ('Transcripts', 'Transcripts', 10, 'closed', 59, '-', '2026-04-06', date '2026-04-06', '20492 (Ellucian) - Religion Mismatched Terms - Terms Showing HISTCAMP', 'Religion Mismatched Terms - Terms Showing HISTCAMP', '[{"id": "20492", "vendor": "Ellucian"}]'::jsonb, null, 'Some Religion courses with a "TR" (transfer) grade were showing a "HISTCAMP" term instead of the correct TR term, and in some cases the transfer-credit term was blank, causing inflated total credit counts.', 'Ellucian (Barry Dunphy)', '4/20/2026 - Resolved', date '2026-04-20', 'None', 'Resolved - HISTCAMP/blank Religion terms corrected to TR in Production; validated via query with no remaining records as of 4/20/2026', null, null, date '2026-09-15'),
  ('Transcripts', 'Transcripts', 10, 'closed', 60, '-', '2026-03-27', date '2026-03-27', '20488 (Ellucian) - End of Transcript Statistics - Incorrect Earned Credit', 'End of Transcript Statistics - Incorrect Earned Credit', '[{"id": "20488", "vendor": "Ellucian"}]'::jsonb, null, 'The Institution Earned credit shown in the End of Transcript Statistics block was calculated incorrectly — first found pulling from Quality Units instead of actual earned credits, then later found to still be wrong after that fix, including not properly excluding retakes.', 'Ellucian (Barry Dunphy)', '4/27/2026 - Resolved', date '2026-04-27', 'None', 'Resolved - End-of-Transcript Earned-credit logic corrected (proper field reference + retake exclusion) and deployed to Production as of 4/27/2026', null, null, date '2026-09-15'),
  ('Transcripts', 'Transcripts', 10, 'closed', 61, '-', '2025-01-30', date '2025-01-30', '20324 (Ellucian) - Transfer Credits Not in the AmCollegeTransfer Table', 'Transfer Credits Not in the AmCollegeTransfer Table', '[{"id": "20324", "vendor": "Ellucian"}]'::jsonb, '26331', 'External transfer credits weren''t populated in the AmCollegeTransfer table (AdEnrollSched missing the AmCollegeTransferID link), so they don''t display under the Transfer Credits folder even though they were accepted; root cause traced to Additional GPA Earned Credits showing 0 despite approved credits.', 'Ellucian (Barry Dunphy, Michel Daran)', '4/23/2026 - Resolved', date '2026-04-23', 'None', 'Resolved - AmCollegeTransferInternal logic extended to cover 3rd-party/Unspecified transfers; fix deployed to Production and approved by Tech Support 4/23/2026', null, null, date '2026-09-15'),
  ('Transcripts', 'Transcripts', 10, 'closed', 62, '-', '2026-04-16', date '2026-04-16', '20499 (Ellucian) - 4. 3rd Party Institution Transfer Credits Incorrect on Transcript', '4. 3rd Party Institution Transfer Credits Incorrect on Transcript', '[{"id": "20499", "vendor": "Ellucian"}]'::jsonb, '923', '3rd-party institution transfer credits showed a mismatch between the External Institution credit (source school) and Internal Institution credit (accepted amount), inflating credits at the end of the transcript.', 'Ellucian (Barry Dunphy, Michel Daran)', '4/23/2026 - Resolved', date '2026-04-23', 'None', 'Resolved - transfer-credit logic corrected to reference AmCollegeTransferInternal for 3rd-party credits; deployed to Production and approved 4/23/2026', null, null, date '2026-09-15'),
  ('Transcripts', 'Transcripts', 10, 'closed', 63, '-', '2025-07-14', date '2025-07-14', '20415 (Ellucian) - 2. Transcript - Degrees Not in Student Therefore Missing on Transcript', '2. Transcript - Degrees Not in Student Therefore Missing on Transcript', '[{"id": "20415", "vendor": "Ellucian"}]'::jsonb, '635', 'Historical degrees/majors earned at BYUI or Ensign (prior to the current system) weren''t reflected on the Anthology transcript because the data wasn''t present on the student''s record in Student.', 'Ellucian (Barry Dunphy, Olivia Leung) / BYU-PW (Kari Johnson, Russell Udall Nash)', '5/8/2026 - Resolved', date '2026-05-08', 'None', 'Resolved - historical BYUI/Ensign degree data mapped via Degree/Honors comment field and deployed to Production; closed 5/8/2026', null, null, date '2026-09-15'),
  ('Transcripts', 'Transcripts', 10, 'closed', 64, '-', '2026-04-28', date '2026-04-28', '20502 (Ellucian) - 3. End of Transcript Statistics - Quality Points Do Not Match', '3. End of Transcript Statistics - Quality Points Do Not Match', '[{"id": "20502", "vendor": "Ellucian"}]'::jsonb, null, 'Quality Points shown in the End of Transcript Statistics didn''t match the expected total when a student had an equivalency/retake pair that both received the same grade.', 'Ellucian (Barry Dunphy)', '4/30/2026 - Resolved', date '2026-04-30', 'None', 'Resolved - Quality Points logic corrected for same-grade retake/equivalency pairs; deployed to Production and validated 4/30/2026', null, null, date '2026-09-15'),
  ('Transcripts', 'Transcripts', 10, 'closed', 65, '-', '2026-01-23', date '2026-01-23', '20472 (Ellucian/BYU-PW) - Escalations', 'Escalations', '[{"id": "20472", "vendor": "Ellucian/BYU-PW"}]'::jsonb, null, 'Placeholder/catch-all item used to track individually escalated student-transcript issues (GPA calculation errors, retake handling, missing external colleges, term-level GPA bugs) that didn''t yet have a dedicated ADO.', 'Ellucian (Barry Dunphy) / BYU-PW (Aniekan Winner Anietie)', '4/8/2026 - Resolved (rolling escalation log)', date '2026-04-08', 'None', 'Resolved - individually escalated GPA/transfer-credit issues logged here were each fixed and validated in Production; last major fix (external-college transfer logic) deployed 4/8/2026', null, null, date '2026-09-15'),
  ('Transcripts', 'Transcripts', 10, 'closed', 66, '-', '2026-03-27', date '2026-03-27', '20489 (Ellucian) - Transfer Credits - Error Message Due to Missing External Course Record', 'Transfer Credits - Error Message Due to Missing External Course Record', '[{"id": "20489", "vendor": "Ellucian"}]'::jsonb, null, 'A set of ~96 Transfer records threw an error or displayed incorrectly because they lacked an associated AmCollegeTransferExternalCourse record, and none were tied to an AdEnrollSched record.', 'Ellucian (Barry Dunphy, Michel Daran)', '4/8/2026 - Resolved', date '2026-04-08', 'None', 'Resolved - 96 orphaned Transfer records (missing external-course record) deleted in Production as of 4/8/2026; a related but distinct orphan pattern flagged for future investigation', null, null, date '2026-09-15'),
  ('Transcripts', 'Transcripts', 10, 'closed', 67, '-', '2026-05-05', date '2026-05-05', '20504 (Client) - 13. Inconsistent Equivalent Course Used in Calculations', '13. Inconsistent Equivalent Course Used in Calculations', '[{"id": "20504", "vendor": "Client"}]'::jsonb, null, 'For a student with an equivalency between 2 courses of different credit values (GS120, 3 credits, taken 2018; GE103, 1 credit, taken 2023 and marked equivalent), the transcript''s Cumulative GPA/term GPA calculations used the 3-credit course while Earned Credits and Quality Points used the 1-credit course, producing an internally inconsistent result.', 'N/A - no resolution details logged in ADO', '5/12/2026 - Closed (no comment history)', date '2026-05-12', 'None', 'Closed - no comments recorded in ADO history; resolution/disposition not documented in the work item', null, null, date '2026-09-15');

